  "body": "A Much Loved Home. A Lifestyle to Love. An Opportunity Not to Miss!\r\n\r\nSome homes just feel right the moment you walk through the door. Welcome to 27 Ian Sage Avenue, Torbay. A beautifully presented, lovingly maintained family home where space, comfort and effortless indoor outdoor living come together.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed family living, the spacious open-plan layout flows beautifully to two separate decks, giving you the choice of where to entertain, unwind or simply soak up the sunshine. Whether it's weekend barbecues, morning coffees or relaxed evenings outdoors, there's a space for every occasion.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n- Beautifully presented and exceptionally well loved\r\n- Spacious, light-filled open-plan living\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Two decks offering options for entertaining and relaxation\r\n- 3 comfortable bedrooms\r\n- 1 well appointed bathroom\r\n- Convenient single-level design\r\n- Double garage with excellent storage\r\n- Partially fenced for privacy, security and peace of mind\r\n- Sought after Torbay location\r\n\r\nWhether you're starting out, growing your family or looking to downsize without compromising on space, this home offers a wonderful combination of comfort, practicality and easy living.\r\n\r\nWith the beach, local shops, parks and everything Torbay has to offer close by, this is a lifestyle opportunity as much as it is a home.\r\n\r\nThe sellers are ready and this home is seriously for sale.\r\n\r\nThis will sell. The only question is, will you be the one who secures it, or will you regret not acting faster? Don't wait for a second chance. Come and see it, make your move and secure your next chapter before someone else does!",
